# "If you have fewer than four cards in hand" is an intervening "if" (CR 603.4), checked as the ability would trigger: the same setup
# as the scenario that draws 1, cast in turn 7, leaves Bot1 four cards in hand after Krang is cast (Island, Plains, Plains, Lightning
# Bolt), so the ability does not trigger at all: the stack is empty once Krang has resolved (? Stack.Count = 0). Casting the Lightning
# Bolt afterwards (hand 3) draws nothing either: had it triggered and only been checked on resolution, it would have drawn 1.

